WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:48.380 --> 00:01:50.620
Someone once said...

00:01:51.320 --> 00:01:54.760
There are souffles that have a soft 
texture and delicate sweetness

00:01:54.760 --> 00:01:58.990
mixed with the refreshing 
sour taste of lemons...

00:01:58.990 --> 00:02:02.300
Soufflemons!

00:02:05.070 --> 00:02:10.000
On nights when the moon is full, 
aromatic, deep-bodied salt-and-sesame

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:13.770
shoots out of the bodies of spotted seals...

00:02:13.770 --> 00:02:17.280
Salt-and-sesaseals!

00:02:18.880 --> 00:02:22.050
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:22.050 --> 00:02:27.520
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:29.390 --> 00:02:32.030
Toriko set out for Heavy Hole's lowest point,

00:02:32.030 --> 00:02:35.260
but was in an agonizing pinch when the 
gravity increased several times over!

00:02:35.700 --> 00:02:40.330
Fortunately, Komatsu's knife 
led him right to food.

00:02:41.530 --> 00:02:44.740
Meanwhile, Komatsu was confronted 
with the shocking truth

00:02:44.740 --> 00:02:46.940
that Melk was a young woman!

00:02:47.610 --> 00:02:51.580
Melk took Komatsu into her 
confidence and revealed her past.

00:02:52.480 --> 00:02:55.010
At last, Toriko reached 
the bottom of Heavy Hole

00:02:55.010 --> 00:02:57.680
and succeeded in meeting 
the first generation Melk.

00:02:58.280 --> 00:03:01.820
Toriko followed the first 
Melk to his workshop...

00:03:04.460 --> 00:03:09.600
Debut! The Second Generation's 
Succession and Melk Stardust!

00:03:12.600 --> 00:03:14.600
This is an impressive rock, isn't it?

00:03:14.600 --> 00:03:16.600
It's called a Microphone Stone!

00:03:18.240 --> 00:03:21.310
It's a wondrous stone that 
can be extracted from

00:03:21.310 --> 00:03:22.870
the vocal cords of a Rock Condor.

00:03:23.110 --> 00:03:27.310
It amplifies and echoes the sounds 
around it several times over.

00:03:31.380 --> 00:03:33.250
This is a Scorpion Demon Bull.

00:03:33.850 --> 00:03:35.290
He's still a young'un,

00:03:35.290 --> 00:03:38.320
but already his strength is 
unrivaled here in Heavy Hole.

00:03:39.520 --> 00:03:43.590
If you had fought with him, he would've 
been more than you could manage, too.

00:03:43.590 --> 00:03:46.230
What in the world are you doing here...?

00:03:46.230 --> 00:03:50.230
I'm in the middle of some 
very important work.

00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:55.510
You see, the Scorpion Demon 
Bull is highly intelligent.

00:03:56.210 --> 00:04:00.240
He stands guard to make sure no one 
interrupts me while I'm working.

00:04:00.940 --> 00:04:03.510
The work is that important...?

00:04:04.880 --> 00:04:06.820
What could it be?!

00:04:18.560 --> 00:04:21.060
Use the rock, for crying out loud!

00:04:21.560 --> 00:04:24.000
Alright. This'll work...

00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:28.640
Now you can talk all you 
want... first-generation Melk.

00:04:29.870 --> 00:04:33.080
You're just as Ryu-san described you, Toriko.

00:04:33.580 --> 00:04:36.250
I don't know what the old man said about me,

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:40.120
but I'm surprised myself. You 
weren't what I was expecting.

00:04:40.120 --> 00:04:41.280
Not what you were expecting?

00:04:41.650 --> 00:04:46.790
I heard you were the shy, silent type, 
but you're actually quite the talker...

00:04:47.420 --> 00:04:50.430
I've always been talkative.

00:04:50.430 --> 00:04:52.660
It's just my appearance, I suppose...

00:04:52.660 --> 00:04:55.760
For some reason, the people 
around me usually ignored me.

00:04:55.960 --> 00:04:58.270
Eh? People ignored you?

00:04:58.970 --> 00:05:00.600
D-Don't tell me you...

00:05:01.300 --> 00:05:03.640
How long have you been using that stone?

00:05:03.640 --> 00:05:06.470
I just found it recently.

00:05:06.470 --> 00:05:10.410
When I use it, the Scorpion 
Demon Bull obeys quickly.

00:05:10.710 --> 00:05:12.010
I knew it!

00:05:12.610 --> 00:05:16.250
He's not shy or quiet...

00:05:16.250 --> 00:05:20.150
I bet it's just that his voice is 
so soft, no one could hear him!

00:05:20.690 --> 00:05:23.390
No wonder the second 
generation was so insecure!

00:05:23.390 --> 00:05:25.190
Second generation, you say?

00:05:25.190 --> 00:05:28.860
Have you met my daughter? What do you think?

00:05:28.860 --> 00:05:30.800
How was her work?

00:05:32.070 --> 00:05:36.770
M-Melk-san, you're a real 
cutler, without a doubt!

00:05:36.900 --> 00:05:38.770
Ch-Chef Komatsu...

00:05:38.770 --> 00:05:41.910
I-It doesn't matter that you're 
a woman or how strong you are!

00:05:41.910 --> 00:05:47.010
The first generation was the first 
generation! Melk-san, you're Melk-san!

00:05:47.980 --> 00:05:52.050
S-Sure, it's incredible that 
the first Melk went out

00:05:52.050 --> 00:05:55.520
and gathered all the materials 
for his knives by himself...

00:05:56.190 --> 00:06:01.030
But that doesn't mean you have 
to imitate him, Melk-san!

00:06:03.260 --> 00:06:07.400
What's important is the 
undeniable fact that you create

00:06:07.400 --> 00:06:09.700
ultra-first-rate knives, Melk-san!

00:06:16.810 --> 00:06:21.010
At first, I thought he'd be back soon...

00:06:21.650 --> 00:06:23.080
...as usual...

00:06:31.020 --> 00:06:35.430
But no matter how long I waited, 
the master didn't come back.

00:06:40.100 --> 00:06:44.170
Even with him gone, the sharpening 
requests didn't stop coming.

00:06:44.170 --> 00:06:47.110
I began to worry about one thing...

00:06:49.210 --> 00:06:52.040
Had something happened to the master?!

00:06:52.980 --> 00:06:56.510
But how could anything happen 
to someone as strong as him?!

00:06:57.450 --> 00:07:01.020
Again, I lamented my lack of strength...

00:07:02.250 --> 00:07:05.590
I can't get near the place he went to.

00:07:06.160 --> 00:07:12.230
All I can do is preserve the name 
of "Melk" until Master returns!

00:07:16.230 --> 00:07:18.600
I have to use all the sharpening 
skills I've learned up to now

00:07:18.600 --> 00:07:23.040
to maintain the trust people 
have in Master's knives!

00:07:27.310 --> 00:07:32.180
But Pochiko has been like that ever 
since, waiting for Master to come back.

00:07:32.920 --> 00:07:34.850
Animals are honest, aren't they?

00:07:34.850 --> 00:07:36.490
I'm not good enough.

00:07:37.050 --> 00:07:43.130
Maybe the chefs that send in their 
knives aren't actually satisfied either

00:07:43.130 --> 00:07:44.930
unless it's the master's sharpening...

00:07:45.490 --> 00:07:46.760
Melk-san...

00:07:50.430 --> 00:07:53.470
Can I borrow some of your knives?

00:07:54.370 --> 00:07:57.340
And I'm going to use some ingredients

00:07:57.340 --> 00:07:58.640
that are in the refrigerator 
downstairs, okay?

00:08:06.980 --> 00:08:08.420
This... and this...

00:08:09.580 --> 00:08:11.620
And this and this...

00:08:14.660 --> 00:08:17.360
I'll need a Kuroko Kitchen Knife 
and a Revival Butcher Knife...

00:08:17.360 --> 00:08:19.390
And a Heavenly Robe Thin Blade...

00:08:22.360 --> 00:08:23.330
Amazing...

00:08:39.550 --> 00:08:41.750
Come on, Melk-san! Let's eat!

00:08:41.980 --> 00:08:44.520
Th-This is... Chef Komatsu...

00:08:44.520 --> 00:08:46.650
First, let's fortify ourselves with a meal.

00:08:49.720 --> 00:08:51.760
My daughter is a prodigy.

00:08:51.760 --> 00:08:55.700
Why, six years ago, when 
she was still just 15...

00:08:55.700 --> 00:08:59.700
...she was already as good a cutler as I was!

00:08:59.970 --> 00:09:03.870
First generation, what's the 
important work that you're doing?

00:09:03.870 --> 00:09:07.210
Did you let your daughter know 
what it was six years ago?

00:09:07.210 --> 00:09:15.010
Of course. My important work is 
creating a new knife for Ryu-san.

00:09:15.010 --> 00:09:18.220
A knife for preparing a salad known as AIR

00:09:18.220 --> 00:09:21.420
from the Gourmet God 
Acacia's Full Course Menu.

00:09:21.990 --> 00:09:24.860
Acacia's Full Course... AIR...?!

00:09:25.120 --> 00:09:30.000
The moment I accepted his request, 
I made up my mind to retire.

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:34.770
Creating that knife requires using 
a great deal of "Melk Stardust".

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:36.670
Melk Stardust!

00:09:36.670 --> 00:09:40.540
I knew it would take many years to complete.

00:09:41.140 --> 00:09:46.080
In fact, it will probably be 
the last thing I ever create.

00:09:46.710 --> 00:09:49.880
I explained everything to 
my daughter in great detail.

00:09:49.880 --> 00:09:55.320
On top of that, I told her, "I entrust 
you to be the second generation!"

00:09:56.390 --> 00:09:58.760
I don't think she was able 
to hear a word that you said.

00:09:58.760 --> 00:10:00.790
Why not?!

00:10:00.990 --> 00:10:02.730
Because your voice is so soft!

00:10:02.730 --> 00:10:05.030
What have I done?!

00:10:05.030 --> 00:10:09.330
The second generation Melk 
seemed tense somehow...

00:10:09.330 --> 00:10:13.700
Maybe this was the reason I didn't 
sense the spirit or composure

00:10:13.700 --> 00:10:15.540
that a first-rate artisan gives off...

00:10:15.710 --> 00:10:17.740
Even if she does have the skills...

00:10:17.740 --> 00:10:20.240
...she doesn't think she's been entrusted 
with being the "second generation".

00:10:20.240 --> 00:10:23.150
She doesn't have complete 
confidence in herself.

00:10:24.310 --> 00:10:28.690
What I thought was her getting 
used to me and then being playful

00:10:28.690 --> 00:10:31.760
from childhood on was actually her 
trying to catch what I was saying?!

00:10:32.520 --> 00:10:35.790
But I can't tell the first 
generation all that right now...

00:10:36.330 --> 00:10:39.030
Only one person can give the 
second generation confidence now.

00:10:39.230 --> 00:10:41.260
I'm counting on you, Komatsu!

00:10:42.700 --> 00:10:47.070
Relax! Your daughter's doing excellent work!

00:10:47.070 --> 00:10:48.740
R-Really?!

00:10:48.740 --> 00:10:51.570
She's doing a fine job as 
the second generation Melk!

00:10:55.810 --> 00:10:57.080
Thank you for the food...

00:11:02.920 --> 00:11:04.820
Delicious!

00:11:04.820 --> 00:11:07.660
Glad you like it. It's 
Lily Oyster Fried Rice.

00:11:07.660 --> 00:11:11.330
Huh... Lily Oyster has this strong a flavor?

00:11:11.330 --> 00:11:13.530
If you use the oyster while it's still closed

00:11:13.530 --> 00:11:16.000
and prepare it through the 
gap, the flavor is enhanced.

00:11:16.530 --> 00:11:19.170
Succinic acid is what gives 
this shellfish its flavor,

00:11:19.170 --> 00:11:22.170
and if it's not exposed to air, 
it continues to enrich the oyster.

00:11:22.170 --> 00:11:25.070
Lily Oysters are Special 
Preparation Ingredients.

00:11:25.070 --> 00:11:28.980
But I couldn't have prepared it without 
your original Kuroko Kitchen Knife.

00:11:30.580 --> 00:11:32.710
Please try some of this dish, too.

00:11:36.120 --> 00:11:39.720
Incredible! This Smoked Jellyfish 
doesn't stink at all!

00:11:39.720 --> 00:11:41.660
Only the tastiness stands out!

00:11:41.660 --> 00:11:43.290
I used your Revival Butcher Knife.

00:11:43.890 --> 00:11:47.300
If you slice it at a certain speed, 
the stink doesn't come out.

00:11:48.160 --> 00:11:51.130
This squid is as soft as jelly...

00:11:51.130 --> 00:11:52.470
...but without your Heavenly Robe Thin Blade,

00:11:52.470 --> 00:11:54.030
it would've been impossible 
to cleanly slice off the skin.

00:11:54.970 --> 00:11:57.710
I used your Chinese Rebellion 
Knife for this...

00:11:57.710 --> 00:12:00.340
For that, I used your Eternal Small Knife...

00:12:00.340 --> 00:12:02.340
I used your Single Stroke 
Willow Blade on that...

00:12:02.340 --> 00:12:03.610
This...

00:12:04.780 --> 00:12:05.950
Melk-san...

00:12:07.780 --> 00:12:13.050
All of this food is only made possible 
through the knives you created.

00:12:13.050 --> 00:12:15.290
You can search anywhere in the world,

00:12:15.290 --> 00:12:19.330
but the only things that can cut 
like this are your knives, Melk-san.

00:12:21.960 --> 00:12:26.400
You're absolutely maintaining the trust 
in the first generation's knives!

00:12:27.530 --> 00:12:32.610
Chefs from all over the world have 
always felt that way... even now!

00:12:33.070 --> 00:12:37.210
Melk-san, you're doing a great job 
preserving the name "Melk Knives"!

00:12:49.190 --> 00:12:52.560
So, about why I came here...

00:12:52.560 --> 00:12:54.830
The second generation wants it, too...

00:12:54.830 --> 00:12:58.600
But the old man asked me to come get some.

00:12:59.530 --> 00:13:02.000
A request from Ryu-san, eh?

00:13:02.000 --> 00:13:04.600
Follow me! I'll take you...

00:13:05.170 --> 00:13:08.040
...to the place where you 
can find "Melk Stardust".

00:13:20.850 --> 00:13:21.550
Oh!

00:13:21.950 --> 00:13:24.220
This is "Melk Stardust"!

00:13:24.220 --> 00:13:26.090
Take as much as you like!

00:13:26.090 --> 00:13:28.360
I'll take you up on that!

00:13:28.360 --> 00:13:32.060
15-Fold Spiked Punch!

00:13:50.080 --> 00:13:52.080
Right! Just like that!

00:13:52.080 --> 00:13:53.350
I did it!

00:13:53.350 --> 00:13:55.320
I knew you could, Chef 
Komatsu! You catch on quick!

00:13:55.990 --> 00:13:59.260
In a matter of days, you 
learned a sharpening technique

00:13:59.260 --> 00:14:01.320
that's said to take normal people a year!

00:14:01.320 --> 00:14:03.990
That's because you're a 
good teacher, Melk-san!

00:14:04.290 --> 00:14:09.070
Incidentally, how many days did it take 
you to learn this sharpening style?

00:14:09.070 --> 00:14:11.030
I was able to do it the first time I tried...

00:14:11.030 --> 00:14:14.000
Amazing... She really is a prodigy!

00:14:16.240 --> 00:14:18.470
Hey! I just got back!

00:14:19.180 --> 00:14:21.610
Sorry I took so long!

00:14:21.610 --> 00:14:22.540
Toriko-san!

00:14:23.580 --> 00:14:25.750
I was worried about you!

00:14:25.750 --> 00:14:30.090
But I'm so happy you're back safely!

00:14:30.090 --> 00:14:30.950
Toriko...

00:14:32.290 --> 00:14:33.260
Welcome back.

00:14:35.560 --> 00:14:37.660
The doubt is gone...

00:14:37.660 --> 00:14:41.030
She's overflowing with the confidence 
of a first-rate artisan.

00:14:41.630 --> 00:14:46.030
It looks like you've fulfilled 
your role perfectly, Komatsu.

00:14:46.730 --> 00:14:48.500
What should I start with?

00:14:49.140 --> 00:14:51.670
I have a ton of things to tell you.

00:14:55.640 --> 00:14:58.880
He just has a quiet voice...? 
Is that even possible?

00:14:58.880 --> 00:15:00.250
Are you serious?

00:15:00.480 --> 00:15:05.620
Certainly, he always seemed 
to be muttering to himself...

00:15:05.620 --> 00:15:08.460
But that aside for the moment...

00:15:08.460 --> 00:15:12.760
I'm just really happy that the 
master is safe and sound...

00:15:13.290 --> 00:15:14.730
And now on to the real issue.

00:15:14.730 --> 00:15:15.460
Look at this!

00:15:17.000 --> 00:15:20.100
W-What are these pretty rocks?!

00:15:20.600 --> 00:15:22.440
C-Could they be...

00:15:22.700 --> 00:15:25.210
Yep. Melk Stardust!

00:15:25.840 --> 00:15:30.410
The almost mythical sharpening stone 
that can sharpen anything in the world!

00:15:30.410 --> 00:15:33.750
So this is Melk Stardust... 
It's so beautiful...

00:15:33.910 --> 00:15:37.920
Remember your promise! Use 
this to make Komatsu a knife.

00:15:38.150 --> 00:15:39.750
Of course! Leave it to me!

00:15:59.910 --> 00:16:01.810
The fang of the Dragon King, Deros!

00:16:03.710 --> 00:16:06.610
The legendary dragon that's said 
to have lived 10,000 years ago...

00:16:07.280 --> 00:16:12.650
With the only fang it had ever grown, 
Deros became the king of this world.

00:16:14.720 --> 00:16:16.960
This is a piece of that dragon king's fang.

00:16:17.520 --> 00:16:20.030
A long time ago, my master discovered 
the fossilized remains of Deros

00:16:20.030 --> 00:16:22.630
and recovered this from it.

00:16:23.560 --> 00:16:26.300
But because of its strength, it 
was too difficult to work with,

00:16:26.300 --> 00:16:27.970
so he left it down there for many years.

00:16:28.500 --> 00:16:32.870
With Melk Stardust, though, it's 
possible to shave and sharpen this!

00:16:33.670 --> 00:16:38.940
D-Don't tell me... you're going to make 
my knife out of that precious material?

00:16:38.940 --> 00:16:41.280
Hey, are you sure about this?

00:16:41.280 --> 00:16:44.550
If we put in an order for that, not 
even several billion would be enough!

00:16:44.550 --> 00:16:46.980
Komatsu, I don't have that kind of money!

00:16:47.180 --> 00:16:48.650
I don't need any money.

00:16:50.020 --> 00:16:54.060
All this time, I've been 
doubting my own ability.

00:16:55.190 --> 00:17:00.330
Not even once did I create a 
knife with real confidence.

00:17:02.370 --> 00:17:05.870
The courage and confidence 
that Chef Komatsu gave me

00:17:05.870 --> 00:17:11.610
swept away the uncertainty that 
had been clinging to my heart.

00:17:12.110 --> 00:17:15.040
I'm deeply... deeply grateful.

00:17:15.550 --> 00:17:19.680
I don't need any money... but I'll make 
the knife with all my heart and soul.

00:17:19.980 --> 00:17:24.190
This is my first job as the 
true "second generation"!

00:17:24.520 --> 00:17:27.220
Th-Thank you!

00:17:27.220 --> 00:17:28.060
However...

00:17:28.920 --> 00:17:31.130
There's one more kind of material.

00:17:31.130 --> 00:17:33.660
I'm going to use this as well, 
if it's alright with you...

00:17:33.660 --> 00:17:35.100
That's...

00:17:35.100 --> 00:17:37.200
Komatsu's broken knife?!

00:17:37.930 --> 00:17:41.300
The knife tells me... "I can still work..."

00:17:42.670 --> 00:17:44.270
It says, "I don't wanna die."

00:17:44.270 --> 00:17:46.440
It's screaming, "I don't 
wanna be separated from him!"

00:17:47.880 --> 00:17:53.010
I've seen all kinds of knives over 
the years, but never one like this.

00:17:53.350 --> 00:17:56.950
It's because you instilled so much 
love into your knife up to now

00:17:56.950 --> 00:17:58.950
that I choose this material 
without hesitation.

00:17:59.550 --> 00:18:03.830
And because I know you would take 
good care of this fang of Deros...

00:18:03.830 --> 00:18:06.790
Besides, I figured this way I'd 
be able to take into consideration

00:18:06.790 --> 00:18:08.500
this broken knife's feelings.

00:18:08.800 --> 00:18:10.770
M-Melk-san...

00:18:10.770 --> 00:18:12.130
You're okay with it, right, Chef Komatsu?

00:18:12.670 --> 00:18:15.500
Of course... Of course I am!

00:18:15.500 --> 00:18:17.670
Thank you!

00:18:21.240 --> 00:18:25.810
Come to think of it, the first Melk 
praised your other knife, Komatsu.

00:18:27.150 --> 00:18:28.780
What's that knife?

00:18:28.780 --> 00:18:33.350
Oh, this knife belongs to my partner, a chef.

00:18:33.350 --> 00:18:37.690
To be honest, without that, I wouldn't 
have been able to make it this far.

00:18:37.690 --> 00:18:38.990
Let me see...

00:18:41.090 --> 00:18:42.300
This is...

00:18:42.300 --> 00:18:45.400
Hmm... I see... It's a fine knife.

00:18:45.400 --> 00:18:47.600
How long has it been...

00:18:47.600 --> 00:18:51.200
since I looked at a knife and 
became interested in its owner?

00:18:52.440 --> 00:18:56.680
Toriko... you've found a wonderful partner.

00:18:57.110 --> 00:18:58.080
Yep.

00:18:59.510 --> 00:19:03.220
I thought my master only 
focused on the knives...

00:19:03.220 --> 00:19:05.720
To think he's shown interest 
in one of their owners...

00:19:05.720 --> 00:19:07.350
But that's because it's Chef Komatsu!

00:19:07.350 --> 00:19:11.920
Nah, all I did was use a knife normally...

00:19:11.920 --> 00:19:15.130
But it's still an honor! For some 
reason, having my knife complimented

00:19:15.130 --> 00:19:18.360
makes me happier than getting 
complimented myself!

00:19:18.730 --> 00:19:21.870
So how long's it gonna take 
you to finish the knife?

00:19:21.870 --> 00:19:24.270
I'd like to take a little time with it.

00:19:24.270 --> 00:19:26.270
I want to be satisfied 
with the knife I create.

00:19:26.270 --> 00:19:27.640
I see...

00:19:27.640 --> 00:19:28.970
Is something wrong?

00:19:28.970 --> 00:19:32.910
Actually... there's this ingredient 
I'm kind of in a hurry to get.

00:19:35.350 --> 00:19:38.420
Show me Ryu-san's list of demands!

00:19:40.550 --> 00:19:42.150
I see...

00:19:42.150 --> 00:19:44.590
All of them are quite difficult to get.

00:19:47.390 --> 00:19:51.060
I think you'd better hurry 
with this "Mellow Cola".

00:19:51.060 --> 00:19:52.630
Why?!

00:19:52.630 --> 00:19:55.200
Right now is when the cola 
is at its most delicious.

00:19:55.770 --> 00:19:59.570
As I recall, you'll be able to 
find it... in the Gourmet Pyramid!

00:20:04.240 --> 00:20:06.480
G-Gourmet Pyramid?!

00:20:06.480 --> 00:20:07.780
I've heard of it!

00:20:08.310 --> 00:20:11.380
A gigantic labyrinth in the 
middle of a vast desert!

00:20:11.380 --> 00:20:13.180
The Gourmet Pyramid!

00:20:13.180 --> 00:20:15.420
No one's ever returned from it...

00:20:15.420 --> 00:20:18.190
...so it's also known as 
the Gourmet Hunter Tomb!

00:20:22.790 --> 00:20:25.960
I'll need Zebra's power for this...

00:21:42.870 --> 00:21:44.470
Dishing with Tina!

00:21:45.010 --> 00:21:47.770
It's "Dishing with Tina", the talk 
show with a heaping helping of fun!

00:21:47.770 --> 00:21:51.710
Our guest today is the Gourmet 
Living Legend, Setsuno-sama!

00:21:51.710 --> 00:21:55.080
You don't need to use "sama" with me.

00:21:55.080 --> 00:21:56.550
Just call me "Setsu-non".

00:21:56.550 --> 00:21:59.450
O-Oh, I couldn't address 
you like we're old friends!

00:21:59.450 --> 00:22:01.020
Who said we're old friends?!

00:22:01.020 --> 00:22:02.660
You're overly familiar, girl!

00:22:02.660 --> 00:22:04.490
I didn't mean to...

00:22:04.720 --> 00:22:09.430
Today, we'll see what makes 
our guest tick with girl talk!

00:22:11.800 --> 00:22:14.030
S-Setsuno-san, what's this set?!

00:22:14.030 --> 00:22:15.330
Call me "Setsu-non"!

00:22:15.330 --> 00:22:17.070
Right. Sorry!

00:22:17.840 --> 00:22:21.110
Today's guest is Tina-san!

00:22:21.110 --> 00:22:22.780
What's your type of man?

00:22:22.780 --> 00:22:24.840
You know, I am the host here...

00:22:24.840 --> 00:22:28.450
I like a man with a pompadour...

00:22:28.450 --> 00:22:31.050
Like Jiro-chan when he was younger...

00:22:31.050 --> 00:22:32.250
W-Who is that?!

00:22:33.320 --> 00:22:35.050
Are you in love right now?

00:22:35.050 --> 00:22:36.460
Um...

00:22:36.460 --> 00:22:39.360
I was in love a lot when 
I was younger, too...

00:22:39.360 --> 00:22:42.260
Inspired by memories of love,

00:22:42.260 --> 00:22:44.330
I created Setsuno's Passionate Plate

00:22:44.330 --> 00:22:46.530
and Setsuno's Moving Meal.

00:22:46.530 --> 00:22:48.530
What a menu!

00:22:48.530 --> 00:22:53.040
But I was especially head 
over heels for Jiro-chan!

00:22:53.200 --> 00:22:56.410
W-Well, we're about out of time...

00:22:56.410 --> 00:22:58.510
Today's guest was Setsuno-san!

00:22:58.510 --> 00:23:00.180
Call me "Setsu-non"!

00:23:00.180 --> 00:23:01.810
Right, Setsu-non!

00:23:01.810 --> 00:23:04.350
And now, let's go on to the next segment...

00:23:07.080 --> 00:23:10.440
Melk's soul, Komatsu's heart, and Toriko's passion...

00:23:10.820 --> 00:23:13.790
All embodied in this single swing!

00:23:14.110 --> 00:23:17.130
A Work Made With All Her Might! The Completed Melk Knife!

00:23:17.410 --> 00:23:19.150
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
